    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gordon Hughes Estate Agents are delighted to present to the market this substantial holding of planted forestry land located in the scenic rural area of Knockvicar, near Lough Key Co. Roscommon comprising of 8.39 hectares (20.73 acres) contained within Folio No RN17762F.\nThis well-positioned parcel of forestry land offers an excellent investment opportunity comprising of roughly 40% Oak & 40% Sitka Spruce - the oak was planted in 1997 & was thinned once & the Sitka Spruce was clear felled in 2025 and replanted in Spring 2026. There is also room for a site alongside the forestry subject to planning permission.\n\nThis site will appeal to forestry investors, landowners and those seeking a long-term rural investment opportunity. Further details, maps and particulars available from Sole Selling Agent. Viewing strictly by appointment only."
      },
